{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方两行大号标题，尤其是紫色强调的“不再需要他陪”“不自在了呢”，位置靠前、字号最大，首先吸引视线。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他越来越担心对方有一天不再需要自己陪伴，甚至不愿意和自己待在一起。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"没底、不安、担忧。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他其实突然安静了，不敢继续往远处想；但对方一直没有退开，两人眼下仍然亲近。以及他可能因为对方喜欢自己在身边而有一点高兴。这些当下状态和细微的积极感受，需要再看下面两块大字才能获得。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"几块同样显眼的文字争夺主视线：顶部紫色标题、中间灰白色大字、底部黄色大字。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里：顶部讲对未来失去陪伴关系的担忧，中间讲眼下仍然亲近，底部讲他有点高兴，需要拼起来才能理解这种担忧与现实之间的关系。\",\n    \"顶部标题本身较长，包含假设情境和两层担忧；快速扫视容易只拿到“不再需要他陪”“不自在”等关键词。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "644561f0-ba0e-4376-937c-6c31b51385b2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T021131516052Z", "elapsed_seconds": 46.5, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:12:18.016950+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1fac24b28916134ed37515a951e31c743f176341e3c0fe4da3bfe9c241806af6", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py"